<title>USA: Novametrix Medical Q4 April 27 revs up.</title>
<headline>Novametrix Medical Q4 April 27 revs up.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novametrix Medical Systems Inc said on Thursday that its revenues for the fourth quarter ending April 27 were $8 million, up from $6.8 million for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Revenues for the year were $28.2 million, compared with $25.3 million the year before.</p>
<p>Full financial results will be released the week of June 17.</p>
<p>The company said it sees additional revenues in the coming year from three new products recently approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>
<p>Novametrix makes medical electronic instruments and sensors.</p>
</text>
